}/* End custom CSS */</style>{"id":213,"slug":"our-story","content":{"raw":"<img width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-1536x480.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-600x188.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    <h2>OUR STORY<\/h2>\n<style>\n.custom-title{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    gap:20px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    margin:0;\n    font-family:\"Jost\", Sans-serif;\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:300;\n    color:#222222;\n    line-height:1;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:80px;\n    height:0.5px;\n    background:#6d6e71;\n    display:block;\n}\n\/* Mobile Responsive *\/\n@media(max-width:767px){\n.custom-title{\n    gap:10px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    font-size:14px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:40px;\n    height:0.25px;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>OUR BEGINNING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>FIERRO was founded in 2006 in the Luxurious city of Dubai - United Arab Emirates with a vision to offer customers a unique shopping experience with a focus on quality, design, and craftsmanship. With a passion for jewelry the founders embarked on a journey to curate a collection\nthat not only captures the essence of elegance but also celebrates individuality.<br><br>\nFIERRO is no stranger in the travel retail industry. With a robust experience of decades, the brand has been faithfully supplying premium jewelry globally, amassing a significant patronage that trust and vouch for the brand\u2019s high-quality offerings. \n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>WHAT WE OFFER<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>At FIERRO, we pride ourselves on offering a diverse range of jewelry pieces that cater to every taste and occasion. Whether you're looking\nfor a statement necklace to elevate your evening look or a pair of delicate earrings for everyday wear, we have something for everyone. Our\ncollection includes a mix of timeless classics and trendy pieces, ensuring that you find the perfect accessory to complement your style.<br><br>\nFrom intricate designs crafted with precision to minimalist pieces that exude sophistication, each jewelry item at FIERRO is a testament to our\ncommitment to excellence. We source the finest materials to create jewelry that not only looks stunning but also stands the test of time. With\nattention to detail and a keen eye for quality, we guarantee that every purchase from FIERRO is an investment in style and elegance.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>OUR MISSION<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>At the core of FIERRO's philosophy is a belief in empowering women to express themselves through jewelry. We understand that jewelry is\nmore than just an accessory \u2013 it's a reflection of your personality, your style, and your story. That's why we strive to offer a diverse range of designs that cater to a myriad of tastes and preferences, ensuring that everyone finds something that resonates with them.<br><br>\nOur mission is to make luxury accessible to all by offering high-quality jewelry at affordable prices. We believe that everyone deserves to\nindulge in a little sparkle and shine, and we're here to make that possible.<br><br>\nAt FIERRO, we don't just sell jewelry \u2013 we offer a glimpse into the world of luxury, elegance, and style. Experience the magic of FIERRO and\nlet your jewelry tell your unique story!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n        <h2>LETS SOCIALIZE <\/h2>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/fierrojewellery\/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Instagram-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Instagram\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61592874454475\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Facebook-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Facebook\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@fierrojewellery\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/TikTok-Icon.svg\" alt=\"TitTok\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/971527794759\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Icon.svg\" alt=\"WhatsApp\"><\/a>\n<style>\n    .social-icons {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n.social-icons a img {\n    width: 35px;\n    height: 35px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n.social-icons a img:hover{\n    scale: .9;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col-social{\n        display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 25px!important;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-line {\n    width: 75px!important;\n    height: 1px;\n    background-color: #6D6E71;\n    justify-self: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px!important;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #222222;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-subtitle{\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #6d6e71;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .social-icons a img {\n        width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s; \n    }\n    .social-icons a img {\n        width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s; \n    }\n    .social-icons {\n        gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-line {\n    width: 35px!important;\n    height: 0.25;\n    background-color: #6D6E71;\n    justify-self: center;\n}\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col-social{\n        display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n}\n}\n<\/style>","rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"213\" class=\"elementor elementor-213\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e9b114 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2e9b114\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d518cb4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d518cb4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-307\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-1536x480.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Our-Story-Page-Banner-600x188.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e147bce e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e147bce\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4691406 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"4691406\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"custom-title\">\r\n    <span><\/span>\r\n    <h2>OUR STORY<\/h2>\r\n    <span><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n.custom-title{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n    gap:20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title h2{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    font-family:\"Jost\", Sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:22px;\r\n    font-weight:300;\r\n    color:#222222;\r\n    line-height:1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title span{\r\n    width:80px;\r\n    height:0.5px;\r\n    background:#6d6e71;\r\n    display:block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Mobile Responsive *\/\r\n@media(max-width:767px){\r\n\r\n.custom-title{\r\n    gap:10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title h2{\r\n    font-size:14px;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title span{\r\n    width:40px;\r\n    height:0.25px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n}\r\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4cf008f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4cf008f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">OUR BEGINNING<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac6e1c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ac6e1c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FIERRO was founded in 2006 in the Luxurious city of Dubai - United Arab Emirates with a vision to offer customers a unique shopping experience with a focus on quality, design, and craftsmanship. With a passion for jewelry the founders embarked on a journey to curate a collection\nthat not only captures the essence of elegance but also celebrates individuality.<br><br>\nFIERRO is no stranger in the travel retail industry. With a robust experience of decades, the brand has been faithfully supplying premium jewelry globally, amassing a significant patronage that trust and vouch for the brand\u2019s high-quality offerings. \n<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df10252 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"df10252\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">WHAT WE OFFER<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-998615c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"998615c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">At FIERRO, we pride ourselves on offering a diverse range of jewelry pieces that cater to every taste and occasion. Whether you're looking\nfor a statement necklace to elevate your evening look or a pair of delicate earrings for everyday wear, we have something for everyone. Our\ncollection includes a mix of timeless classics and trendy pieces, ensuring that you find the perfect accessory to complement your style.<br><br>\nFrom intricate designs crafted with precision to minimalist pieces that exude sophistication, each jewelry item at FIERRO is a testament to our\ncommitment to excellence. We source the finest materials to create jewelry that not only looks stunning but also stands the test of time. With\nattention to detail and a keen eye for quality, we guarantee that every purchase from FIERRO is an investment in style and elegance.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0d29b4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0d29b4c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">OUR MISSION<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b812d6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b812d6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">At the core of FIERRO's philosophy is a belief in empowering women to express themselves through jewelry. We understand that jewelry is\nmore than just an accessory \u2013 it's a reflection of your personality, your style, and your story. That's why we strive to offer a diverse range of designs that cater to a myriad of tastes and preferences, ensuring that everyone finds something that resonates with them.<br><br>\nOur mission is to make luxury accessible to all by offering high-quality jewelry at affordable prices. We believe that everyone deserves to\nindulge in a little sparkle and shine, and we're here to make that possible.<br><br>\nAt FIERRO, we don't just sell jewelry \u2013 we offer a glimpse into the world of luxury, elegance, and style. Experience the magic of FIERRO and\nlet your jewelry tell your unique story!<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c5bcb15 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"c5bcb15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bsh-heading-social\" class=\"social\">\r\n 